OL,3,GNEWSAWill Young set to make garden show
OL,4,Adebut
OL,5,
OL,6,FWill Young is set to make his garden
OL,7,Fdesign debut at this year's Royal
OL,8,FHorticultural Society (RHS) Wisley
OL,9,FFlower Show.
OL,11,FThe Evergreen singer has collaborated
OL,12,Fwith designer Jamie Butterworth to
OL,13,Fcreate an installation, titled Out of
OL,14,Fthe Shadows.
OL,16,FThe RHS says the piece "interprets
OL,17,Fpsychologist Carl Jung's concept of the
OL,18,F'shadow self', the parts of ourselves
OL,19,Fwe keep hidden from the world".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
